WEBVTT

1
00:00:01.500 --> 00:00:05.000
Lesson 4.3 · People, Culture & Volunteers
Contracts and terms

2
00:00:05.600 --> 00:00:11.800
Every working relationship needs written terms, starting with the one between co-founders.

3
00:00:13.000 --> 00:00:15.600
1. Sign a short founders' agreement on roles and exits.

4
00:00:15.600 --> 00:00:18.200
2. Make sure work created belongs to the organisation.

5
00:00:18.200 --> 00:00:22.200
3. Check the rules where you are before anyone starts.

6
00:00:22.800 --> 00:00:24.600
You list each working relationship and the terms it needs.

7
00:00:24.600 --> 00:00:28.600
Then save it, and download it as a PDF.

8
00:00:30.100 --> 00:00:33.200
Method into Impact
Better foundations. Stronger organisations.
